B.body:
Hi {first_name},

I mentioned you can connect WorkflowMAX to your AI tool. Worth being specific about why that matters, because it is not really about the AI.

An assistant can only answer from what it can read. If the lead sits in a CRM, the quote in a spreadsheet and the time somewhere else again, nothing it can reach holds a whole project. So it answers a fraction of the question, and people conclude AI is not ready.

With WorkflowMAX the lead, the quote, the job, the costs and the invoice are one record, so the questions get simple. What is due to invoice this month. How much is sitting in work in progress. Which clients actually made money last quarter. Rather than describe it, here is a walkthrough for you.

