Hi {first_name},

We have built a migration tool specifically for Harvest customers. Start a trial, connect your Harvest account, and your clients, jobs and time history come across into WorkflowMAX as they are.

Nothing changes on the Harvest side. It is a copy, not a move, so you can look without committing to anything.

What you end up with is your own work sitting in a system that also holds the lead, the fee proposal and the budget that came before the job started. That is the part that is missing today, and it is much easier to see with your own jobs in front of you than in a demo.

